face-verify-demo

This project includes integration code for third-party libraries and model
formats. The project source code is licensed under the MIT License.

Third-party dependencies are installed from requirements.txt and are governed
by their own licenses.

Model assets are not distributed by default:

- InsightFace model packs, such as buffalo_l, are downloaded by InsightFace at
  runtime and are documented upstream as non-commercial research assets:
  https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface/wiki/Dataset-Zoo
- MiniFASNet ONNX weights must be obtained separately. Keep the source URL and
  license for the exact weights used before redistribution. Common upstream
  references include:
  https://github.com/minivision-ai/Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing
  https://github.com/yakhyo/face-anti-spoofing

Do not include biometric samples, captured frames, embeddings, identity
documents, private logs, or secrets in public releases.
